  "description": "A production-ready .NET compression library providing efficient, thread-safe compression for the built-in BCL algorithms (GZip, Deflate, and on net10+ Brotli, ZLib). Additional algorithms (LZ4, LZMA, Snappier, Zstd, BZip2, XZ) ship as separate Lyo.Compression.* addon packages so consumers only pay for what they use.",
